@2058 = ~Copper Coronet +1~

@2059 = ~Though forged of simple copper, this coronet hums with protective elven enchantments that stave off wear and tear. It was created to mark the construction of the Copper Coronet, Athkatla’s notorious tavern. Whispers in the Slums suggest that the structure's eccentric architect wore the piece until the day she died. In the centuries since, the crown has passed through an endless chain of shady vendors and traveling merchants, slowly drifting north until it arrived in Baldur's Gate.

STATISTICS:
- +5 walking speed
- +20 magic resistance~

