@2068 = ~Ghost~

@2069 = ~Isaac Wildflame~

@2070 = ~Scroll~

@2071 = ~This ancient scroll are soaked with evil energy. Though unclear how Alma came into possession of such powerful spell, it's going to prove handy. The incantation dispels the magical barrier that enshrouds the system of caves beneath Torm's Hand.~

@2072 = ~Bow of Silent Leaves~

@2073 = ~Enchanted with powerful magic, Bow of Silent Leaves is a perfect ranged weapon for archers. Some stories claim the bow is a remnant after an ancient elven tribe from forests of Tethyr, others claim it was forged for Ellesime herself - the queen of Suldanesselar. The truth isn't known, but the bow is a formidable weapon due to elven magic application.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
- Luck: +1
- Dexterity: +1 (when equipped)~

