@2086 = ~Durbem's Key~

@2087 = ~A finely wrought golden key. Its intricate design is covered with tiny symbols and delicate engravings. It belongs to Durbem, the dwarf at the Purple Wyrm Inn; what it opens remains a mystery.~

@2088 = ~Friendly Cat~

@2089 = ~A friendly stray cat that seems content to wander the streets in search of food.~

